12
00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.825 line:15%
Drew, this is huge!

13
00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:25.040 line:15%
I know!

14
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.150 line:15%
I keep telling my girls, I'm just like,

15
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.890 line:15%
this is such a dream of mine.

16
00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.790 line:15%
I love the news so much and I just can't believe

17
00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.320 line:15%
