26
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:50.983
Thank you.

27
00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:51.816
I'll just, I'll be watching,

28
00:00:51.816 --> 00:00:52.649
I'll be outside the window waving.

29
00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:54.200
Hi! Hi, Drew. (laughs)

30
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.170
All right. Well, let's kick off our news today

31
00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.627
by looking back in a new segment we're calling

32
00:00:58.627 --> 00:01:01.367
"This Day in Pop Culture History".

33
00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:03.930
(whirring sounds)

34
00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.884
That's right.

35
00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:05.844
(Ross laughs)

36
00:01:05.844 --> 00:01:08.070
