37
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.490
Check this out.

38
00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:12.760
On this day, in 1977, a young radio hopeful

39
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.200
took the airwaves for the very first time

40
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.635
on WRNW

41
00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:20.330
in Briarcliff Manor, New York.

42
00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.310
Who was it?

43
00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:24.050
Just a little fella named Howard Stern.

44
00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.265
Howard was 23 years old and his first shift

45
00:01:26.265 --> 00:01:31.265
