46
00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:36.250
He now reportedly makes 1.9 million a week.

47
00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.330
Here's a quick listen to Howard back in 1977.

48
00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.270
Hi, I'm Howard Stern,

49
00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.540
the program director of Westchester's rock station.

50
00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.190
You know, it's really hard to describe

51
00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:48.470
what makes a radio station a success.

52
00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:50.950
We hear WRNW have narrowed it down

53
00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:53.130
