100
00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.130
Hmm, have you ever gotten back with an ex?

101
00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.000
Ah. Oh, my God.

102
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.232
Around the bend, many times.

103
00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.320
(Ross laughs)

104
00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:57.060
If I dated 17 years ago, a guy,

105
